# ValueScope runs without any API keys.
#
# Market data comes from Yahoo Finance (keyless), deep history from the SEC's
# XBRL API (keyless), and earnings call transcripts from the defeatbeta dataset
# on HuggingFace (keyless).

# Optional. Fallback source for earnings call transcripts, used only when the
# primary dataset is unavailable. Free key, email signup, no card:
#   https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# Note the free tier allows only 25 requests per day, which is why it is a
# fallback rather than the primary source.
ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY=

# Optional. Enables the "Summarize this call" button on the earnings call page,
# the one-tap earnings digest on the S&P 500 calendar (which summarises every
# call on a day with Gemini), and the AI comp picker — the last rung of peer
# discovery for tickers no curated set or similarity data covers. Free tier, no
# card; the digest paces itself to stay inside its rate limit:
#   https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Server-side only — the key is never sent to the browser. Without it the button
# is simply not shown.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Trades reasoning for speed on the summary pipeline's Gemini calls
# by sending thinkingConfig.thinkingLevel with this value (e.g. low). Unset,
# nothing is sent. Set it if summaries run close to the function time limit.
GEMINI_THINKING_LEVEL=

# Optional. Vercel Blob storage for AI artifacts: operating-KPI series keyed
# by filing, earnings call summaries keyed by ticker and quarter, and daily
# digests keyed by the calls they cover. Create a Blob store in the Vercel
# dashboard and this variable appears in the project automatically; pull it
# locally with `vercel env pull`. Without it, KPI extraction still works in
# local dev (in-memory, lost on restart) and simply doesn't render in
# production; summaries and digests still work but are regenerated instead of
# served from the store — three Gemini calls per summary every time, and no
# "what changed" shortcut from the prior quarter's stored extraction. Worth
# creating: it is one click in the dashboard and free at this volume.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
